<p>
This makes it easy to update the intros whenever something changes. For example, if a speaker turns out to be available during the conference for a live Q&amp;A session, I can update the Org entry for their talk (set <code>:Q_AND_A: live</code>), regenerate the intro slide, and re-record the Q&amp;A explanation or even copy-and-paste one from a different intro. They can also change their talk title and that's totally okay. Yay Emacs!
